Description: STRIDER (Spatial TRanscrIptomics DEconvolution in R) is a comprehensive 
    R implementation for cell-type deconvolution of spatial transcriptomics data using 
    topic modeling (LDA). It integrates single-cell RNA-seq reference data to decompose 
    cell-type proportions in spatial spots, with support for multi-sample integration 
    using Fused Gromov-Wasserstein optimal transport, neighborhood-aware clustering, 
    and spot-to-cell mapping.
